  "description": "*\"Huh? Me? The vampire queen?\"*\n\nIn a world where vampires and humans coexist, an ordinary human named Han Ye-Seul ends up applying to Baekse High School, a school for only vampires, by a ridiculous mistake. In order not to be found out that she is human, she dyes her hair and wears contact lenses, but was it too much? Everyone sees her as a legendary pure-blooded vampire and reveres her as a queen! \n\nSince it has come to this, I will play the role of the perfect vampire queen until I transfer in a year! Although she resolves this, her human nature is lost when Chan-Gyeol finds out about her in the bathroom. As she gets entangled with Chan-Gyeol, she continues to get involved in strange things.\n\nWill Han Ye-Seul be able to safely complete her year at this vampire school teeming with vampires and transfer?\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
